flowchart TD
  BOOK[Accepted booking / approved quote] --> CREATE[Server creates payment attempt + idempotency record]
  CREATE --> PSP[PSP checkout / collection]
  PSP --> EVENT[Webhook received]
  EVENT --> VERIFY[Verify signature, timestamp, event identity]
  VERIFY -->|Invalid| REJECT[Reject and security-log safe metadata]
  VERIFY -->|Valid| DURABLE[Persist event id uniquely]
  DURABLE --> PROCESS[Idempotent status transition]
  PROCESS --> LEDGER[Append balanced ledger entries]
  LEDGER --> STATE[Update payment projection]
  STATE --> RECON[Reconcile PSP transactions and settlements]
  RECON -->|Mismatch| ALERT[Alert finance/security; investigate, no blind retry]
  RECON -->|Matched| READY[Eligible for payout per approved policy]
  READY --> PAYOUT[PSP payout request with separate idempotency]
  PAYOUT --> SETTLE[Verify payout result / settlement evidence]
